elier sur un aménagement.\u003C\u002Fp>\n","Un Niva, c&rsquo;est un mètre de coffre. Le module qui s&rsquo;y loge tient en un tiroir compartimenté, un couvercle qui devient plan de travail, et une glacière calée contre le passage de roue. Le bois a reçu une teinte foncée, à la demande du propriétaire, et la façade porte le dahut gravé — la seule [&hellip;]","2026-09-04T00:52:08+00:00","2026-09-04T02:15:40+00:00",{"id":214,"src":346,"mime":347,"alt":348,"title":349,"caption":10,"width":98,"height":350,"sizes":351},"\u002Fmedia\u002F2026\u002F09\u002F2410-lada-niva-tomas-masa-01.jpg","image\u002Fjpeg","Lada Niva – module compact : Lada Niva, photographie 1 du reportage","Lada Niva – module compact — 1",1920,{"medium":352,"large":355,"thumbnail":358,"medium_large":360,"1536x1536":362},{"src":353,"width":354,"height":20},"\u002Fmedia\u002F2026\u002F09\u002F2410-lada-niva-tomas-masa-01-200x300.jpg",200,{"src":356,"width":357,"height":84},"\u002Fmedia\u002F2026\u002F09\u002F2410-lada-niva-tomas-masa-01-683x1024.jpg",683,{"src":359,"width":88,"height":88},"\u002Fmedia\u002F2026\u002F09\u002F2410-lada-niva-tomas-masa-01-150x150.jpg",{"src":361,"width":91,"height":114},"\u002Fmedia\u002F2026\u002F09\u002F2410-lada-niva-tomas-masa-01-768x1152.jpg",{"src":363,"width":84,"height":128},"\u002Fmedia\u002F2026\u002F09\u002F2410-lada-niva-tomas-masa-01-1024x1536.jpg",{"section_de_textes":365,"caracteristiques_du_projet":367,"contenu_de_larticle":378,"image_pleine_largeur":481},{"titre":366,"premier_texte":341},"Le plus petit volume de l'atelier",{"date_du_projet":368,"type_damenagement":369,"prix_du_projet":370,"credit_photos":371,"module_installe":376,"vehicule":377},"Octobre 2024","Module amovible","2 900 €",{"url":372,"title":373,"target":374,"external":375},"https:\u002F\u002Fnicoreirgen.github.io\u002Fconceptions-du-dahut\u002F","Les Conceptions du Dahut","_blank",true,null,"Lada Niva",[379,397,431,464],{"layout":380,"image":381},"image_seule",{"id":382,"src":383,"mime":347,"a